{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "1. 当用户反复要求具体信息时，必须直接回答，避免反问或绕圈子，否则会迅速消耗用户耐心。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "2. 对价格敏感用户推荐产品时，应优先推荐预算内最优选项，再通过对比展示升级价值，而非直接推荐超预算产品。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "3. 用户提及竞品参数（如15ms延迟）时，需主动对比并解释差异原因，同时强调自身优势，避免用户自行判断。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "4. 保修和价格附加费是价格敏感用户的常见异议，需提前准备延保方案和价格保障承诺（如“到手价无附加费”）。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "content": "5. 用户说“再想想”时，应主动提出下一步行动（如锁定库存、提供试用），而非重复推荐，否则对话陷入僵局。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "name": "预算内锚定+升级对比法", "condition": "用户预算明确且价格敏感，但愿意为显著性能提升多付少量费用。", "example": "先推荐预算内最优产品（如2000以内A型号），再对比升级产品（如2500预算可考虑B型号，延迟从25ms降到9ms，保修从1年升到2年含换屏），强调升级带来的价值差异。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "name": "竞品参数拆解回应法", "condition": "用户提及竞品具体参数（如延迟15ms）时。", "example": "先承认竞品优势（“15ms确实不错”），再解释自身参数差异的原因（“25ms在入门级已属优秀”），最后引导到自身优势（“但我们有9ms的型号，比竞品还低”）。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "name": "价格保障承诺法", "condition": "用户反复质疑价格真实性或担心附加费时。", "example": "明确承诺“到手价无附加费”，并提供具体保障措施（如订单备注、赠品补偿），消除用户顾虑。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "objection": "25ms延迟算流畅吗？我同学用的才15ms。", "rebuttal_template": "您说得对，15ms确实更流畅。不过25ms在入门级里已经属于优秀水平，日常记笔记完全够用。如果您对延迟特别敏感，我们有一款{产品名}延迟仅9ms，价格{价格}，比同学的15ms还低，而且保修2年含换屏，您要不要对比一下？", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "objection": "保修1年够用吗？能延保吗？", "rebuttal_template": "保修1年是行业标准，但我们提供延保服务，{延保价格}可延长至2年，包含{具体服务}。另外，如果您选择{升级产品}，原厂就带2年保修和一次免费换屏，算下来比单独延保更划算。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260522_201620_price_sensitive_student", "persona_id": "price_sensitive_student", "outcome": "TIMEOUT", "objection": "你说的2000以内是到手价吗？别到时候又要加钱。", "rebuttal_template": "您放心，2000以内是含税到手价，没有任何附加费。如果您下单，我会在订单备注“价格保障”，确保您支付的就是这个价格。另外，现在下单还赠送{赠品}，相当于再省{金额}。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260522_201751"}
